---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { demoUrl, appUrl } from '../data/site';
---
<SiteLayout title="Let’s talk — Valtireo"><section class="page-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">LET’S START WITH YOUR ORGANIZATION</span><h1>A clearer way to work<br/>starts with <em>a conversation.</em></h1><p>Explore the workflows that matter to your team and how they could come together in Valtireo.</p></section><section class="container contact-grid"><div class="conversation-card"><span class="eyebrow">A PRODUCT WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>Make it relevant to your team.</h2><p>A useful conversation starts with a few things:</p><ul><li><Icon name="check"/>Your organization’s size and structure</li><li><Icon name="check"/>The processes you want to improve</li><li><Icon name="check"/>The modules you would like to explore</li></ul>{demoUrl ? <a class="button button-dark" href={demoUrl}>Request a walkthrough <Icon size={18}/></a> : <div class="availability-note"><strong>Demo booking will be available soon.</strong><p>The contact destination for this website hasn’t been published yet. No request is collected or sent from this page.</p></div>}</div><aside class="access-card" id="workspace-access"><span class="eyebrow">ALREADY USING VALTIREO?</span><h2>Your workspace awaits.</h2><p>Use the workspace link provided by your organization’s administrator.</p>{appUrl ? <a class="button button-dark" href={appUrl}>Go to sign in <Icon size={18}/></a> : <p class="availability-note">The public sign-in link will be added here when it is available.</p>}<a class="text-link dark-link" href="/product/">Explore the platform <Icon size={18}/></a></aside></section></SiteLayout>
